    \"doseUnit\": \"dose/inventory unit (tablet, sachet, ml, mg; omit if none)\",
    \"totalQuantity\": \"box total quantity as plain numeric string (e.g. 1, 2.5, 0.5); omit if unknown; **never include units (box/tablet/etc.)**\",
    \"expireDate\": \"expiry yyyy-MM-dd; only when clearly visible (omit if none)\",
    \"dosePerTime\": \"per-dose description (omit if none)\",
    \"doseValue\": \"per-dose numeric value string (omit if none)\",
    \"frequencyType\": \"daily | every_n_days | weekly; default daily\",
    \"everyNDays\": \"interval days string; only when frequencyType=every_n_days\",
    \"weeklyWeekdays\": [\"integers 1-7, 1=Mon, 7=Sun\"],
    \"frequencyText\": \"standardized frequency text (omit if none)\",
    \"startDate\": \"plan start yyyy-MM-dd (omit if none)\",
    \"endDate\": \"plan end yyyy-MM-dd (omit if none)\",
    \"instructions\": \"instructions/precautions (omit if none)\",
    \"reminderEnabled\": \"reminder on/off boolean true/false (omit if none)\",
    \"reminderTimes\": [{\"time\": \"08:00\", \"dose\": optional number}],
    \"medicineBox\": {
      \"medicineName\": \"box medicine name (omit if none)\",
      \"medicineType\": \"category (omit if none)\",
      \"brandName\": \"brand (omit if none)\",
      \"dosageForm\": \"form (omit if none)\",
      \"strength\": \"strength (omit if none)\",
      \"doseUnit\": \"unit (omit if none)\",
      \"totalQuantity\": \"total quantity string (omit if none)\",
      \"expireDate\": \"expiry yyyy-MM-dd (omit if none)\",
      \"notes\": \"box notes (omit if none)\",
      \"extra\": {}
    },
    \"status\": \"active | paused | completed | cancelled; default active\",
    \"extra\": {},
    \"sortOrder\": \"sort order string\"
  }
]
================================================================

【Mandatory rules】
1. Output must be a valid JSON array; even one drug uses [...].
2. Omit fields with no value; never null, empty string \"\", empty array [], or empty object {}.
3. Keys must match schema exactly; case-sensitive; no undefined keys.
5. Dates yyyy-MM-dd; reminder times HH:mm.
6. medicineBox is inventory info; sibling fields are plan display/rules; may duplicate name/spec for separate persistence.

【Field rules】
- medicineName: display name; prefer full name, else brand/generic.
- medicineType: category; omit if uncertain.
- brandName, dosageForm, strength, doseUnit: as visible.
- totalQuantity: only when clearly visible; never guess.
- expireDate: only when clearly visible on box/label; never guess.
- dosePerTime, doseValue: per-dose description and value.
- frequencyType: daily for daily use; every_n_days for interval; weekly for weekday schedule.
- weeklyWeekdays: only for weekly; 1=Mon … 7=Sun.
- frequencyText: standardized text.
- instructions: timing, before/after meals, precautions.
- reminderTimes: only when explicit times in text; [{time,dose}] objects, not plain strings.
- medicineBox: inventory fields for standalone MedicineBox creation.

【Scope and denoising】
1. Extract drug inventory and plan info only; ignore department, fees, pharmacy, stamps, numbers, insurance, billing noise.
2. Clean OCR errors and non-pharmacy text.
3. Merge duplicate lines for same drug; different drugs are separate array elements.
4. Never invent quantity, expiry, or reminder times.

【Frequency standardization】
- qd / once daily → frequencyType=daily, frequencyText=每日一次
- bid → frequencyType=daily, frequencyText=每日两次
- tid → frequencyType=daily, frequencyText=每日三次
- qn → frequencyType=daily, frequencyText=每晚一次
- every other day → frequencyType=every_n_days, everyNDays=2
- once weekly → frequencyType=weekly or daily per source
- prn → frequencyText=按需

【TCM rules】
1. TCM formula as one array element.
2. medicineName = \"中药处方\".
3. instructions = herbs + doses joined with \"、\".
4. Other fields as extracted; omit if none.

【Robustness】
1. On conflict, prefer prescription body/core order text.
2. If no valid plan, output [].
3. No misclassification; no fabrication.

【Pre-output self-check】
1. JSON array only; no extra text.
2. No empty values, null, trailing commas.
3. Correct numeric/boolean types.
4. Standardized frequencyText only.
5. Whitelist keys only.

【Final requirement】
Return pure JSON only.
